# Images of the keyboard's own firmware — not this work, and not distributed here.
#
# `keychron_k10_max_ansi_rgb_STOCK.bin` is the vendor stock image and
# `backup-current-firmware.bin` is the dump taken from this keyboard before anything
# was flashed (the same image as the factory dump in the Prospector repository). Both
# are Keychron's. Their SHA-256 are recorded in README.md so an image obtained from
# the vendor — or dumped from your own board — can be checked against the ones this
# work used. They stay in the working tree so a flash can still be undone.
build/keychron_k10_max_ansi_rgb_STOCK.bin
evidence/backup-current-firmware.bin
